{"id":"e637becf421e4e61","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-category-data.md","title":"Set-Coded Category Operations","display":"df-category-data — Set-Coded Category Operations","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-category-data","aliases":["58-df-category-data"],"display":"df-category-data — Set-Coded Category Operations","depends_on":["[[58-df-category.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-category-data"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-category-data</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-category-data — Set-Coded Category Operations"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a87b7e1119b63b2c\" href=\"?note=a87b7e1119b63b2c\" title=\"58-df-category.md\">58-df-category.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)\\)</span>；以下范畴取值函数只在这个域上使用。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in O\">\\(X,Y\\in O\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\\in M\">\\(f,g\\in M\\)</span>；复合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,g,f)\">\\(\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,g,f)\\)</span> 的参数域另要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t(f)=s(g)\">\\(t(f)=s(g)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\in V\">\\(F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S\\)</span> 是二元函子数据的两个投影。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ob}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ob}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Obj}\">\\(\\operatorname{Obj}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Mor}\">\\(\\operatorname{Mor}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}\\)</span> 与下述 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CatHom}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CatHom}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S\\)</span> 是所给公式定义的函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\operatorname{Mor}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\operatorname{Mor}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,g,f)\">\\(g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,g,f)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}^{\\mathcal C}_X=\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{id}^{\\mathcal C}_X=\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}}=\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}}=\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> 是有明确环境参数的记号。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProductCategory}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\mathrm{ProductCategory}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\)</span> 仅在两个参数均满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Category}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Category}_S\\)</span> 时使用，积的对象和箭头均使用有序对编码。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComposedFunctor}_S(G,F)\">\\(\\mathrm{ComposedFunctor}_S(G,F)\\)</span> 的定义域要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\mathcal A\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(F:\\mathcal A\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal C\">\\(G:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal C\\)</span> 满足所引函子谓词；它取二元函子代码，而不是把函子本身当作对象函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}objects}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq O,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq O,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq M.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}objects}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq O,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq O,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq M.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}hom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in M:s(f)=X\\land t(f)=Y\\},\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}hom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in M:s(f)=X\\land t(f)=Y\\},\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}source\\text{-}target}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\\coloneqq s(f),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\\coloneqq t(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}source\\text{-}target}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\\coloneqq s(f),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\\coloneqq t(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}identity\\text{-}composition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\coloneqq e(X),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,g,f)\\coloneqq c(\\langle g,f\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}identity\\text{-}composition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\coloneqq e(X),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,g,f)\\coloneqq c(\\langle g,f\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functor\\text{-}projections}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle)\\coloneqq F_0,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle)\\coloneqq F_1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functor\\text{-}projections}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle)\\coloneqq F_0,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle)\\coloneqq F_1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}opposite\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle O,M,t,s,\n\\{\\langle\\langle g,f\\rangle,c(\\langle f,g\\rangle)\\rangle:f,g\\in M\\land t(g)=s(f)\\},e\\right\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}opposite\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle O,M,t,s,\n\\{\\langle\\langle g,f\\rangle,c(\\langle f,g\\rangle)\\rangle:f,g\\in M\\land t(g)=s(f)\\},e\\right\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProductCategory}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\langle{}&amp;\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\times\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D),\n\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\times\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D),\\\\\n&amp;\\{\\langle\\langle f,g\\rangle,\\langle\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f),\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal D,g)\\rangle\\rangle:\nf\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\land g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\{\\langle\\langle f,g\\rangle,\\langle\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f),\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal D,g)\\rangle\\rangle:\nf\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\land g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\{\\langle\\langle\\langle f&#39;,g&#39;\\rangle,\\langle f,g\\rangle\\rangle,\n\\langle\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,f&#39;,f),\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal D,g&#39;,g)\\rangle\\rangle:\nf,f&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\land g,g&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\land\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)=\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f&#39;)\n\\land\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal D,g)=\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal D,g&#39;)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\{\\langle\\langle X,Y\\rangle,\\langle\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal C,X),\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal D,Y)\\rangle\\rangle:\nX\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\}\\Bigr\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProductCategory}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\langle{}&amp;\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\times\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D),\n\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\times\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D),\\\\\n&amp;\\{\\langle\\langle f,g\\rangle,\\langle\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f),\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal D,g)\\rangle\\rangle:\nf\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\land g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\{\\langle\\langle f,g\\rangle,\\langle\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f),\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal D,g)\\rangle\\rangle:\nf\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\land g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\{\\langle\\langle\\langle f&#39;,g&#39;\\rangle,\\langle f,g\\rangle\\rangle,\n\\langle\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,f&#39;,f),\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal D,g&#39;,g)\\rangle\\rangle:\nf,f&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\land g,g&#39;\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{30mm}\\land\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)=\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f&#39;)\n\\land\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal D,g)=\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal D,g&#39;)\\},\\\\\n&amp;\\{\\langle\\langle X,Y\\rangle,\\langle\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal C,X),\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal D,Y)\\rangle\\rangle:\nX\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\}\\Bigr\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComposedFunctor}_S(G,F)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(G)\\circ\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(F),\n\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(G)\\circ\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(F)\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ComposedFunctor}_S(G,F)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(G)\\circ\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(F),\n\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(G)\\circ\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(F)\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>取值函数由六元范畴编码的唯一分量确定；不存在自由选择的 Ob、Mor 或 Hom 原语。</li>\n<li>相反范畴保留箭头编码而交换源靶，复合次序在函数图中明确反转。</li>\n<li>函子的对象映射与箭头映射始终分开，不能把二元函子代码本身当成一个在对象和箭头上都可求值的普通函数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-category.md","status":"resolved","id":"a87b7e1119b63b2c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-category.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\langle O,M,s,t,c,e\\rangle\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y\\in O","display":false},{"tex":"f,g\\in M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,g,f)","display":false},{"tex":"t(f)=s(g)","display":false},{"tex":"F=\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Ob}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Obj}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mor}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CatHom}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\operatorname{Mor}_{\\mathcal C}(X,Y)=\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f=\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,g,f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}^{\\mathcal C}_X=\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal C,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C^{\\operatorname{op}}=\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProductCategory}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Category}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComposedFunctor}_S(G,F)","display":false},{"tex":"F:\\mathcal A\\to\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"G:\\mathcal B\\to\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}objects}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq O,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Obj}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq O,\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq M.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}hom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in M:s(f)=X\\land t(f)=Y\\},\n\\qquad\\operatorname{Hom}(\\mathcal C,X,Y)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{CatHom}_S(\\mathcal C,X,Y).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}source\\text{-}target}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\\coloneqq s(f),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)\\coloneqq t(f).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}category\\text{-}identity\\text{-}composition}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal C,X)\\coloneqq e(X),\n\\qquad\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,g,f)\\coloneqq c(\\langle g,f\\rangle).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}functor\\text{-}projections}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle)\\coloneqq F_0,\n\\qquad\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(\\langle F_0,F_1\\rangle)\\coloneqq F_1.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}opposite\\text{-}category}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OppositeCategory}_S(\\mathcal C)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\langle O,M,t,s,\n\\{\\langle\\langle g,f\\rangle,c(\\langle f,g\\rangle)\\rangle:f,g\\in M\\land t(g)=s(f)\\},e\\right\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ProductCategory}_S(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\n\\Bigl\\langle{}&\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\times\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D),\n\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\times\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D),\\\\\n&\\{\\langle\\langle f,g\\rangle,\\langle\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f),\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal D,g)\\rangle\\rangle:\nf\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\land g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\},\\\\\n&\\{\\langle\\langle f,g\\rangle,\\langle\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f),\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal D,g)\\rangle\\rangle:\nf\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\land g\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\},\\\\\n&\\{\\langle\\langle\\langle f',g'\\rangle,\\langle f,g\\rangle\\rangle,\n\\langle\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal C,f',f),\\mathrm{CatCompose}_S(\\mathcal D,g',g)\\rangle\\rangle:\nf,f'\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\land g,g'\\in\\operatorname{Mor}(\\mathcal D)\\\\\n&\\hspace{30mm}\\land\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f)=\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal C,f')\n\\land\\mathrm{CatCodomain}_S(\\mathcal D,g)=\\mathrm{CatDomain}_S(\\mathcal D,g')\\},\\\\\n&\\{\\langle\\langle X,Y\\rangle,\\langle\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal C,X),\\mathrm{CatIdentity}_S(\\mathcal D,Y)\\rangle\\rangle:\nX\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\land Y\\in\\operatorname{Ob}(\\mathcal D)\\}\\Bigr\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComposedFunctor}_S(G,F)\\coloneqq\n\\langle\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(G)\\circ\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(F),\n\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(G)\\circ\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(F)\\rangle.","display":true}],"bytes":4807,"backlinks":[{"id":"ff4636701b68a3a3","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CoendIndexingData}_{\\mathsf{meta}}$ 是断言中展开的六元谓词；$\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{op}}\\times\\mathcal C$ 的对象、箭头与复合使用 [[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]] 的明确集合编码。"},{"id":"08f4a3081239a349","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2aed7ac2ed3313e0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f798fc3990a5c443","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9a02fd87820572ba","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4ea8fe70b7dab958","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"797ed4ec0ca2a08f","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"f7ee6b96f80ad0a8","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"5f28c17da801f47c","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6eedc7cef16ac70e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dfa5042443233c40","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1f5113ef45d8213e","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"7200e183a0335a63","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"50b20f786d960883","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D_0=\\mathrm{FunctorObjects}_S(D)$，$D_1=\\mathrm{FunctorArrows}_S(D)$。$s_J,t_J$ 是 $J$ 的源、靶映射；$gf=g\\circ_{\\mathcal C}f$ 使用 [[../batch04/58-df-category-data.md]] 的实际复合函数。"},{"id